# Async Multi Select

A multi-select component that fetches data asynchronously from a URL and allows multiple selection with advanced controls.

## Installation

::div{.space-y-4}
```bash
bunx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/async-multi-select.json
```

```bash
npx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/async-multi-select.json
```

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/async-multi-select.json
```
::

## Usage

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import { AsyncMultiSelect } from '@/registry/async-multi-select'

const selectedOptions = ref([])
</script>

<template>
  <AsyncMultiSelect
    v-model="selectedOptions"
    url="https://api.example.com/options"
    k="id"
    v="name"
    :config="{
      emptyMessage: 'Select one or more options',
      emptySearchMessage: 'No results found',
      searchPlaceholder: 'Search...',
    }"
  />
</template>
```

