### Registry dependencies

::deps{type="shadcn" :external="false" :dependencies='[{"text": "command"}, {"text": "button"}, {"text": "typography"}, {"text": "loading-swap"}]'}
::

### Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Required | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `url` | `string` | `undefined` | `true` | The URL to fetch data from. |
| `sourceKey` | `string` | `undefined` | `false` | The key in the response JSON that contains the data array. |
| `k` | `keyof T` | `undefined` | `true` | The property name used as the unique identifier for items. |
| `v` | `keyof T` | `undefined` | `true` | The property name used for display text. |
| `config` | `Object` | `Default Spanish labels` | `false` | Configuration for labels and placeholders. |

### Configuration Object (`config`)

| Property | Type | Default | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `emptyMessage` | `string` | `'Seleccione una o varias opciones'` | Message shown when no items are selected. |
| `emptySearchMessage` | `string` | `'No se encontraron resultados'` | Message shown when search returns no results. |
| `searchPlaceholder` | `string` | `'Buscar...'` | Placeholder for the search input. |

## Simple Async Select

A simpler version of the select component that uses the standard Shadcn UI Select for single selection from an asynchronous source.

### Usage

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import { AsyncSelectSimple } from '@/registry/async-multi-select'

const selectedValue = ref('')
</script>

<template>
  <AsyncSelectSimple
    v-model="selectedValue"
    url="https://api.example.com/options"
    label-key="name"
    value-key="id"
    placeholder="Select an option"
  />
</template>
```

### Props (AsyncSelectSimple)

| Prop | Type | Default | Required | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `url` | `string` | `undefined` | `true` | The URL to fetch data from. |
| `sourceKey` | `string` | `undefined` | `false` | The key in the response JSON that contains the data array. |
| `valueKey` | `string` | `undefined` | `true` | The property name used as the value. |
| `labelKey` | `string` | `undefined` | `true` | The property name used for display text. |
| `placeholder` | `string` | `'Select an option'` | `false` | Placeholder for the select trigger. |
| `empty` | `string` | `'No options found'` | `false` | Message shown when no options are available. |
